  "description": "USN-8944-1 updated ca-certificates. This update provides the corresponding\nchanges for Ubuntu 14.04 LTS, Ubuntu 16.04 LTS, Ubuntu 18.04 LTS, and\nUbuntu 20.04 LTS by removing the \"emSign ECC Root CA - G3\" and \"Comodo AAA\nServices root\" CA certificates.\n\nOriginal advisory details:\n\n This update removes the \"emSign ECC Root CA - G3\" CA certificate due to\n intermediate CA certificates being compromised.\n\n In addition, in Ubuntu 22.04 LTS, Ubuntu 24.04 LTS, and Ubuntu 26.04 LTS,\n the ca-certificates package contained outdated CA certificates. This\n update refreshes the included certificates to those contained in the 2.90\n version of the Mozilla certificate authority bundle.",
